    <text>conical coaxial capacitors and their advantages in an
    example cited the ratios of maximum to minimum capacitance for
    disk cylindrical and conical capacitors are respectively an
    approximate equation is derived for the conical capacitor and
    close agreement is shown between computed and measured values
    of capacitance</text>
  </DOC>
