    <text>information need studies (a case-history of a bio-medical
    research institute). in an effort to develop a procedure for
    recurring information need studies within the international
    medical information system (medinform), the bulgarian procedure
    was tested in the ussr. this comprised a questionnaire survey
    designed to elicit users' attitudes towards the system.</text>
  </DOC>
