    <text>libraries and development in the solomon islands. aims to
    show that libraries are not a luxury but basic to the
    development of the solomon islands. presents a state of the art
    review of the public library scene in the solomons, and
    suggests that libraries should be within easy reach of the
    whole population of the solomon islands, with free and open
    access to all.</text>
  </DOC>
