    <text>some basic terminology connected with mechanical
    languages and their processors the suggestions in this paper
    are part of the terminology used in work for the university of
    pennsylvania's office of computer research and education. the
    work is jointly supported by the national science foundation
    and the air force office of scientific research. august, 1961
    gorn, s. ca610801 jb march 16, 1978 10:16 pm</text>
  </DOC>
