    <text>considerations on the case for a specific standard for
    the description of old books. examines ifla's draft isbd(a) of
    nov 78, noting differences and similarities with isbd(m).
    concludes that a more satisfactory solution would be to produce
    an appendix to isbd(m) providing for all cases where a larger
    measure of descriptive detail was appropriate.</text>
  </DOC>
