    <text>optimal program and data locations in computer networks
    an optimization procedure for the allocation of program and
    data files in a computer network is presented. this algorithm
    takes into account the dependencies between files and programs
    such as occur in real heterogeneous computer networks. insights
    into whether or not to convert programs from one computer to
    another can also be gained from the model. a search procedure
