    <text>in memoriam. marcel koelbert 1903-1979. homage by a
    personal friend, giving an account of the career of koelbert,
    who from 1932-62 was chief librarian at the university of
    algiers. here koelbert created an important documentation
    centre despite the difficulties inherent in the situation.
    details are given of his most significant achievements.</text>
  </DOC>
