    <text>dc amplifiers for control systems</text>
  </DOC>
  <DOC>
    <recordId>2573</recordId>
    <text>electron ion recombination at low pressures experiments
    throwing light on the nature of the fundamental processes
    involved are discussed the molecular ion is thought to play a
    decisive part the evidence is consistent with the hypothesis of
    dissociative recombination</text>
  </DOC>
