    <recordId>2734</recordId>
    <text>reduction of the minimum striking voltage of hydrogen
    thyratrons an auxiliary tripping circuit is described by means
    of which the output voltage of a line type thyratron pulse
    generator is made continuously variable from</text>
  </DOC>
