    <text>solar activity and whistler dispersion the time delay
    between the occurrence of a local lightning flash and the
    beginning of the associated whistler is correlated with the
    monthly mean sunspot number the correlation coefficient is
    greatest when the sunspot number is related to whistler
    measurements made months later</text>
