    <recordId>3071</recordId>
    <text>application factors for electrical resolvers the device
    described resembles a small motor and was originally designed
    for solving a trigonometry problems in conjunction with
    analogue computers possible applications for control purposes
    in industry are discussed</text>
  </DOC>
