    <text>an addendum to the sex structuring of organizations: the
    special case of traditionally-female professions. efforts to
    account for the sex structuring of organisations are extended
    to the special case of traditionally-female professions.
    schein's career stages and transition points form the basis for
    the sex-structuring framework used in the analysis. particular
    attention is given to the library field. (see also previous
    abstract.).</text>
