    <text>definition of the national documentary heritage. after
    providing a general definition of national heritage and
    national documentary heritage, introduces the different
    categories of documents which make up the latter' written
    documents, both print and manuscript, iconographic documents,
    sound, visual and machine readable material. in conclusion, a
    definition-synthesis of national documentary heritage, is
    proposed.</text>
