    <recordId>3273</recordId>
    <text>improvement of 'spresi' code terms by using them in
    calculation of chemical properties by structural and additive
    methods. describes the use of the spresi fragmental code for
    the isolation in chemical compounds of the structure fragments
    which are used in the calculation of the properties of chemical
    compounds by structure and additive methods.</text>
  </DOC>
