    <text>generation of permutations in lexicographic order
    (algorithm 323 [g6]) february, 1968 ord-smith, r. j.
    permutations, lexicographic order, lexicographic generation,
    permutation generation 5.39 ca680205 jb february 23, 1978 12:04
    pm</text>
