    <recordId>8346</recordId>
    <text>a novel electronic transmit receive switch a type valve
    capable of withstanding between grid and cathode isolates the
    receiver from the transmitter tank circuit</text>
  </DOC>
  <DOC>
    <recordId>8347</recordId>
    <text>basic elements of cobol 61 may, 1962 sammet, j. e.
    ca620502 jb march 20, 1978 1:54 pm</text>
  </DOC>
