    <text>the distribution of temperature along a thin rod
    electrically heated in vacuo part theoretical an integral
    expression derived for the temperature distribution can be
    expanded as a convergent power series for evaluation two
    regions are defined region a in the middle of the rod and
    region b the portions outside a in the a region temperature
