    views his application as manipulation of information in
    two-dimensional pictures of tables, business forms, and reports
    on a display terminal. he can gradually automate this
    application by giving "examples" to the system of how he
    manually manipulates the information. the query-by-example
    database language is a subset of the sba programming language.
