    program was discussed which is capable of calculating various
    quantities of interest in tensor calculus. this appendix is
    intended as an example of the program output. chrisoffel
    symbols calculated for 12 basic orthogonal coordinate systems
    are listed. march, 1967 walton, j. j. ca670312 jb february 28,
