    <text>media project: teletext and prestel. new information
    services for voluntary organisations?. the way in which social
    agencies and voluntary organisations could make use of teletext
    and viewdata to disseminate information about their work to
    seek volunteers, to raise money and to provide an information
    service in their area of work is discussed.</text>
