    <text>present phase of solar cycle observations of the
    intensity of the coronal green line suggest that the minimum of
    solar activity is flatter and lower than that of a first
    indication of the rise of the new cycle was observed at the
    beginning of august the next maximum is expected to occur
    between summer and the end of and to be rather low</text>
  </DOC>
