    <text>the effect of atmospheric rotation on the orbital plane
    of a near earth satellite theoretical formulae are derived for
    the rotation of the orbital plane and change in orbital
    inclination of a near earth satellite due to the influence of
    the atmosphere</text>
  </DOC>
