    <text>equivalent circuit for a passive nonreciprocal network a
    nonreciprocal quadripole is considered comprising an ideal
    amplifier and phase shifter compared with the gyrator
    representation this method facilitates the linking of the
    network parameters with measurements</text>
  </DOC>
  <DOC>
    <recordId>9937</recordId>
    <text>the choice of base a digital computer is considered,
    whose memory words are composed on n r-state devices plus two
    sign bits (two state devices). the choice of base b for the
    internal representation of floating-point numbers on such a
    computer is discussed. it is shown that in a certain sense b= r
    is best. october, 1969 brown, w. s. richman, p. l.
    floating-point, accuracy, base choice, number representations
    5.11 6.32 ca691003 jb february 15, 1978 3:33 pm</text>
