    storage allocation the material presented in this paper is part
    of the design plan of the core allocation portion of the
    ascii-matic programming system. project ascii-matic is
    concerned with the application of computer techniques to the
    activities of certain headquarters military intelligence
    operations of the u.s. army. october, 1961 holt, a. w. ca611005
    jb march 16, 1978 1:02 pm</text>
  </DOC>
