    reference to lists and illustrated catalogues prepared by
    special libraries; the classification of images, in relation to
    the inadequacy of conventional systems, systems developed for
    slide collections, archival classifications, and classification
    of photographic techniques; and indexing procedures used by
    special libraries in the fields of petroleum, management and
    urban planning, medicine, education, archaeology and the
