    <text>an on-line program for non-numerical algebra the goal of
    this program is to make a step toward te design of an automated
    mathematical assistant. some requirements for such a program
    are: it must be easy to access, and that the result must be
    obtained in a reasonably short time. accordingly the program is
    written for a time-shared computer. the q-32 computer as system
