    <text>an evaluation of reference sources used by public
    libraries in three illinois regional library systems. presents
    the results of a questionnaire survey to evaluate the
    information sources most used by practicing reference
    librarians in the northern illinois, river bend and starved
    rock library systems. the questionnaire listed 243 titles of
    reference works and asked for ratings as essential, recommended
    or peripheral. data is tabulated and analysed.</text>
  </DOC>
