    <text>on a possible mechanism of solar nonstable processes
    leading to neutron eruptions the hypothesis is proposed that
    the formation within the sun of a nucleus with increased
    lithium concentration may be the initial cause of nonstable
    processes of all kinds and in particular the formation of
    sunspots</text>
  </DOC>
