    maintained at any desired level r inc independent of the gain
    or the amount of feedback by using a fixed amount of the total
    feedback to achieve the impedance reduction and apportioning
    the remainder so that where r and k are the current and voltage
    feedback factors of this remainder three commonly used circuits
    incorporating this feature are discusr attention is devoted to
