    and differentiation assistant (grad assistant) now under
    development is a set of lisp functions which symbolically
    manipulate abd differentiate algebraic expressions. it is
    designed for use with problemms in which a large amount of
    routine manipulation is to be done by a program without human
    intervention. thus, grad must recognize necessary
    simplifications without external guidance. while some
    complicated expressions (notably ones involving nested radicals
    and trigonometric functions) do not yield completely to the
