    <text>state bibliography in the 11th five year plan. as an
    important tool of ideological education, bibliography will have
    an important role to play in the solution of concrete social
    and economic problems in the next 5 years. concentrates on the
    work of the centre for the state bibliography-the vsesoyuznaya
    knizhnaya palata (all-union book chamber). the main aim will be
    to optimise the system of information sources and to improve
    the quality of state bibliography. 1 of the main projects
    planned for the next 5 years will be the publication of a
    series of standards on information science, librarianship and
    publishing. automation will be the major aid in the improvement
    of effectiveness of bibliographical work in future.</text>
  </DOC>
