    by heating the exospheric gas by hydromagnetic shock waves the
    more energetic component consists of protons a flux hydrogen
    atoms should be observed at the base of the exosphere and the
    decay time of the ring should be less at sunspot minimum than
    at sunspot maximum by a factor of three</text>
