    <text>the amplification of very wide frequency bands various
    techniques for amplification in bandwidths exceeding are
    discussed and the suitability of cascade and distributed
    amplifiers is investigated direct and indirect methods of delay
    line equalization are outlined and details are given of a seven
    stage distributed amplifier with gain over a band</text>
