    given value of applied voltage the life is shortened if the
    voltage gradient is increased for a given ratio between applied
    voltage and initial ionization voltage the life is considerably
    shortened if ambient temperature is raised certain
    considerations regarding the impregnation of capacitors with
    mineral oil are discussed</text>
