    <text>delay line equalizer experimental equipment designed for
    low definition television can be used either in conjunction
    with test signals or on lines in service manual adjustments are
    made according to the position of the pulse on the oscillograph
    screen a total delay of is provided in steps of and the cut off
    frequency</text>
  </DOC>
