    <text>floating-point arithmetic in cobol in this paper the
    basic operations of floating-point arithmetic are examined and
    cobol procedures for carrying these out are given, along with
    specification of working storage. the paper concludes with an
    example in which these procedures are used. may, 1962 kesner,
    o. ca620509 jb march 20, 1978 1:46 pm</text>
