    <recordId>12340</recordId>
    <text>powers on electronic publishing. the variety of different
    forms which electronic publishing takes is considered with
    particular reference to on-line information services, personal
    computers, interactive tv, electronic yellow pages,
    broadcasting and cable tv, videocassettes and videodiscs and
    on-demand printing. brief details are given of each of these
    technologies.</text>
  </DOC>
