    <text>a demonstration of promis. the problem-oriented medical
    information system at the medical center hospital of vermont. a
    study was conducted to evaluate the impact of the
    problem-oriented medical information system (promis), which is
    based on an automated problem-oriented medical record, by
    comparing the records for 2 generally comparable medical wards,
    one using the computerised promis record and the other using
    its manual prototype.</text>
