    <recordId>16817</recordId>
    <text>the phased superposed epoch method of analysis and an
    application to geomagnetic activity a method is described in
    which geomagnetic activity variations are analysed by grouping
    the data according to their phases increasing decreasing or no
    change as determined by considering the characteristics for
    pairs of successive days</text>
  </DOC>
