    <recordId>16819</recordId>
    <text>a semi empirical expression for the first townsend
    coefficient of molecular gases the formula derived by
    druyvesteyn and penning is discussed and is modified on the
    basis of different assumptions regarding the energy dependence
    of the scattering cross sections of the gas molecules</text>
  </DOC>
