    <text>statistical results and their short comings concerning
    the ionosphere within the auroral zone the difficulties of
    obtaining significant data from high latitude curves are
    discussed together with the statistical treatment of such data
    these difficulties could be minimized by the adoption of the
    recommendations of the ursi high latitude committee</text>
  </DOC>
