    <text>library activities celebrating national heritage year in
    france. survey of the numerous diverse activities organised by
    french libraries to mark the occasion in 1980. details are
    given of exhibitions, cultural activities, publications,
    inventories and restoration projects, and notable acquisitions,
    with particular emphasis on the provincial libraries which the
    press tends to ignore in favour of paris events.</text>
  </DOC>
