    <recordId>17255</recordId>
    <text>sard kernels for certain bivariate cubatures an error
    analysis for some bivariate cubatures is given. the remainders
    are obtained by the use of sard kernels. numerical results and
    computer graphs are given for some of the kernel functions.
    september, 1973 barnhill, r. e. pilcher, d. t. cubatures, sard
    kernels, numerical integration, remainder formulas 5.13 5.16
