    maser for the conditions considered the effect is small the
    spontaneous emission equivalent temperature for a free electron
    vacuum tube amplifier is one half that of a maser in principle
    more general quantum mechanical amplifiers can be constructed
    which will not have spontaneous emission noise</text>
  </DOC>
