    <text>component design trends fixed resistors show stability
    improvements a survey of available types temperature voltage
    and power limits are discussed composition resistors continue
    to be the most generally used developments in pyrolytic carbon
    film printed wire wound and metal film types are
    reported</text>
  </DOC>
