    community and to defeating cultural elitism in art libraries is
    discussed with special attention to the place of art libraries
    in third world countries. after the evolution and propagation
    of major national and international art library associations
    are traced, the tasks of these associations in promoting,
    creating, and preserving artistic traditions of the individual
    areas in the spirit of creative internationalism are
    outlined.</text>
