    <text>the library technician and the documentation technician:
    twelve years later. compares the results of a 1980 quebec
    survey of documentation technicians with a 1975 survey of
    library technicians, to assess the changes resulting from the
    introduction of the new qualification. the main conclusion is
    that while new responsibilities have been created, there are
    still no real career opportunities for non-professional library
    staff.</text>
