    <recordId>18497</recordId>
    <text>motions in the magnetosphere of the earth the
    magnetosphere is defined as the region above the ionosphere in
    which the earths magnetic field has dominant control over the
    motions of gas and fast charged particles conditions in the
    magnetosphere and the mymamical behaviour of its constituents
    are discussed</text>
  </DOC>
