    <text>generation ad measurement of highly ionized quiescent
    plasmas in steady state a simple generation technique is
    described experimental results validate double ambipolar
    diffusion in homogeneous dc magnetic fields and give a
    recombination coefficient of plasmas below</text>
  </DOC>
