    <text>trends in research on reading habits in quebec. a survey
    of quebec research projects from 1972 on. topics covered
    include: quebec and canadian readers; reading and television;
    quebec and french statistics; reader demands; young readers;
    reading and study habits ; library efficiency; and satisfaction
    of reader requirements.</text>
  </DOC>
