    <text>computerised communications and the telecommunications
    manager. it is felt that changes in the telecommunications
    environment during the 80s will have a considerable impact upon
    decision-making in most us corporations. traces the background
    to the increasing need for data communications, electronic
    mail, facsimile transmission, etc. particular attention is paid
    to the facilities offered by computerised telephone
    systems.</text>
  </DOC>
