    <text>managing multisite polytechnic library services. outlines
    managerial problems common to multisite polytechnic libraries
    in these times of economic stringency. discusses' styles of
    management; allocation of resources; rationalisation of
    systems; staff allocation; management of growth; staff
    development; and communication problems.</text>
  </DOC>
