    cycles the pulsations remain in phase but on occasions they are
    in antiphase the period of the geomagnetic pulsations suggests
    that they are due to toroidal hydromagnetic oscillations of the
    outer atmosphere possible connections with ionospheric
    absorption are briefly considered</text>
