    <text>journal selection models' past and present. a review is
    given of mathematical models applied to journal selection and
    decision problems. various models are examined, analysed, and
    compared. such features as the specific decision problem
    examined, decision criterion, methodology employed, and data
    required are considered. current research and practice are
    examined to predict future trends in materials
    selection.</text>
