    <text>riverside methodist hospital library resource centre.
    briefly describes the development of the library resource
    centre at riverside methodist hospital, columbus, ohio, with a
    step-by-step account of how josephine yeoh, the library
    director, convinced the hospital administration of the need for
    significantly more space for the library. a plan of the library
    is included.</text>
