    <recordId>20027</recordId>
    <text>the conduct of user surveys. after general comments about
    user surveys, discusses their goals, the variety of such
    surveys, and offers some methodological pointers on the conduct
    of user surveys. above all, researchers must ask themselves why
    they are conducting the survey, so that the survey will be
    designed in such a way that it helps researchers to answer
    their most important questions.</text>
  </DOC>
