    <text>the diurnal and annual variations of ionization an
    interpretation values of and log in the formula calculated from
    records for are tabulated the variation of these values is
    discussed and a model is derived for layer conditions in which
    the temperature gradient is smaller in summer than in
    winter</text>
  </DOC>
