    <recordId>33644</recordId>
    <text>new library in vagan authority. vagan, norway, has 9,700
    inhabitants, of whom 4,000 live in svolvaer. svolvaer library
    has a bookstock of 39,000 volumes' there are 5 branches. a new
    library was opened in nov 79, sharing a building with district
    medical and dental services. the library occupies the ground
    floor, which houses lending departments, reading rooms, local
    collection and exhibition area, and part of the basement, used
    for stacks, study rooms, rooms for meetings and other
    activities, and accommodation for a mobile library
    service.</text>
  </DOC>
  <DOC>
    <recordId>33645</recordId>
