    <text>prevailing wind in the ionosphere and geomagnetic
    variations it is shown theoretically that the prevailing
    ionospheric wind makes no contribution to the geomagnetic
    current system despite the diurnal variation of ionospheric
    conductivity see also of</text>
  </DOC>
