    <text>at general motors wp-input produces colour slides.
    financial and other data stored in the computer are retrieved
    and processed on word processors in the form of tables and
    graphs for presentation at executive meetings. the output from
    the word processor is passed through equipment designed to
    produce colour slides.</text>
