    <text>guidelines for curriculum development in information
    studies. these guidelines for curriculum development for
    documentalists, information specialists, information
    scientists, and librarians stress the need for all parties to
    the information process, in whatever capacity or country, to
    receive a common training that will enable them to understand
    one another and to collaborate on equal terms to the progress
    of information transfer. report not available from ntis.</text>
