    <recordId>34109</recordId>
    <text>electronic office-metamorphosis and other stories. the
    impact of new technologies on the office is examined. the word
    processor will form the central point of electronic office
    activity and present experience suggests that future activity
    will spread from this point. word processor-telex links,
    teletex, facsimile transmission, prestel, and the
    stored-program controlled telephone exchange are among the
    developments considered.</text>
  </DOC>
