    <text>spread f in baguio through half a solar cycle a
    statistical survey over six years shows that the occurrence of
    spread f is associated with periods of downward movement of
    ionization the seasonal and diurnal variation of occurrence is
    also markedly different between periods of high and low solar
    activity</text>
  </DOC>
