    <recordId>34275</recordId>
    <text>graphical analysis of some transistor switching circuits
    methods are described for generating the entire input
    characteristics for the various terminals of a transistor and
    graphical methods of analysis are applied to a base input
    amplifier a collector to emitter direct coupled switching
    circuit a collector to base direct coupled circuit</text>
  </DOC>
