    <text>on the nonexistence of a phrase structure grammar for
    algol 60 algol 60 is defined partly by formal mechanisms of
    phrase structure grammar, partly by informally stated
    restrictions. it is shown that no formal mechanisms of the type
    used are sufficient to define algol 60. september, 1962 floyd,
    r. w. ca620909 jb march 17, 1978 7:33 pm</text>
  </DOC>
