    <text>diverse networks to electrify mail. in the usa, recent
    surveys of major fortune 1000 companies reveal that more than
    30% of the nation's major industrial concerns have implemented
    or are planning to implement internal electronic mail systems.
    new proposals are submitted to the federal communications
    commission regularly for more public electronic message or data
    communications networks. examines some recently proposed
