    <recordId>35024</recordId>
    <text>a method for testing and establishing the rating of
    semiconductor rectifiers under dynamic conditions</text>
  </DOC>
  <DOC>
    <recordId>35026</recordId>
    <text>ionization processes in the electrical breakdown of gases
    a brief review</text>
  </DOC>
