    <text>eigenvectors of a 2n x 2n matrix it has been known that
    the eigenvalues of a certain 2n x 2n matrix can be obtained by
    use of two smaller matrices of order n which can be easily
    constructed. an algorithm is given to obtain the eigenvectors
    of the 2n x 2n matrix by use of the eigenvectors of the smaller
    matrices. december, 1967 charmonman, s. ca671207 jb february
    26, 1978 2:22 pm</text>
