    <text>on the cascaded tunnel diode amplifier a mid band
    equivalent circuit of an artificial transmission line is
    described for use with tunnel diodes in cascade amplifiers see
    only one diode is needed in each stage and the shunt resistor
    is an ordinary passive component</text>
