    <text>standby generating plant for the manchester edinbugh
    television radio relay link description of equipment driven by
    an ic engine which automatically restores the supply voltage at
    unattended relay stations in case of mains failure for more
    than two seconds the sets are given daily test runs remotely
    controlled from attended stations</text>
