    <text>investigations of current noise in resistors report of
    noise voltage measurements over the frequency range kcs with
    film resistors the mean square noise voltage usually varies
    approximately inversely as frequency for resistors exhibiting
    such a frequency variation the noise is proportional to the
    direct voltage applied deviations from this frequency
