    <text>a search for radio emission at m from the local
    supergalaxy</text>
  </DOC>
  <DOC>
    <recordId>35905</recordId>
    <text>the miller integrator as sawtooth voltage generator the
    theory of the miller integrator is discussed and practical
    circuits of the transitron and practical circuits of the
    transitron and sanatron an integrator with separate controlling
    valnent values is considered in detail</text>
  </DOC>
  <DOC>
    <recordId>35906</recordId>
    <text>permutation generator (algorithm 87) october, 1962
    schrack, g. f. shimrat, m. ca621013 jb march 17, 1978 7:14
    pm</text>
