    vertical rocket investigations carried out in ussr between and
    showed that contrary to established opinion above the e layer
    there is only a very shallow minimum in electron density the
    electron density increases up to with a maximum at km and then
    slowly decreases so that at km the density is electrons
    cm</text>
  </DOC>
