    <text>junction transistor circuits application of the pnp
    junction type transistor in single stage and cascaded
    amplifiers and in lf and rf oscillators is described and
    illustrated by eight circuit diagrams the transistor collector
    characteristics and operating data and typical circuit
    component values are given</text>
  </DOC>
