    2.43 3.20 3.24 3.50 3.51 3.52 3.53 3.54 3.55 3.56 3.57 3.70
    3.71 3.72 3.73, 3.74, 3.75, 3.80, 3.81, 3.82, 3.83, 5.0, 5.1,
    6.2, 6.21, 6.22 ca681211 jb february 21, 1978 12:16 pm</text>
  </DOC>
