    <recordId>37059</recordId>
    <text>a simplified derivation of the manley and rowe power
    relationships</text>
  </DOC>
  <DOC>
    <recordId>37060</recordId>
    <text>basics of online searching. presents a unified picture of
    bibliographic searching by computer, through an examination of
    the principles of interactive on-line searching. examples are
    based on the brs, dialog and orbit search services, covering
    the nature of on-line searching, the kinds of files available
    on-line, commands used to search them, and search
    strategy.</text>
