    <text>a report on the bookshop practical course. report on a
    short course held at the papua new guinea regional training
    centre, may 81, aimed at developing booksellers' knowledge of
    bookselling, and reviewing basic bookselling skills, such as
    care, knowledge and control of stock, bibliography, display and
