    <recordId>37337</recordId>
    <text>characteristic values and associated solutions of
    mathieu's differential equation (algorithm 352 [s22]) july,
    1969 clemm, d. s. mathieu's differential equation, mathieu
    function, characteristic value, periodic solution, radial
    solution 5.12 ca690714 jb february 15, 1978 6:30 pm</text>
  </DOC>
