    <text>complexity of computations the framework for research in
    the theory of complexity of computations is described,
    emphasizing the in terrelation between seemingly diverse
    problems and methods. illustrative examples of practical and
    theoretical significance are given. directions for new research
    are discussed. september, 1977 rabin, m. o. complexity of
    computations, algebraic complexity, in tractable problems,
    probabilistic algorithms 5.25 ca770901 jb december 28, 1977
    6:54 am</text>
  </DOC>
