    <text>the secant method for simultaneous nonlinear equations a
    procedure for the simultaneous solution of a system of
    not-necessarily-linear equations, a generalization of the
    secant method for a single function of one variable, is given.
    december, 1959 wolfe, p. ca591203 jb march 22, 1978 3:39
    pm</text>
