    <text>the frequency dependence of the dielectric properties of
    dipolar substances inconsistencies in previous theories of
    dipolar interaction are pointed out a new theory presented is
    based on debyes theory of molecular relaxation and on an
    application of onsagers method for treating es
    interaction</text>
  </DOC>
