    <text>electronic mail' also of interest to the printing
    industry? he possibilities of electronic mail are examined and
    examples are given of the ways in which data mail is replacing
    postal and telex services in the us. the advantages of
    electronic mail are discussed with reference to 2 case studies
    and the increased nationalisation of electronic mail through
    packet switching is examined.</text>
