    <text>going it alone' a library stays independent. outlines the
    history of the public library services in wolseley,
    saskatchewan from the opening of the farmers' institute in 1893
    to the present when citizens have voted not to join the
    regional systems. discusses reasons for this decision.</text>
  </DOC>
