    <text>subject source analysis' access characteristics of
    obscenity law research materials. illustrates, through the
    exploration of one subject area, the strengths and flaws of
    some of the standard tools in legal research. whilst working
    through the subject of obscenity throws light on only one
    subject speciality, it reveals paradigms applicable to all
    research endeavours.</text>
  </DOC>
