    chandor gives an international overview of viewdata and data
    processing. a.r. haimes discusses in-house viewdata systems
    with descriptions of the terminals, applications and future
    trends. b.r. ashdown discusses bulk updating of
    viewdata/videotex systems describing the method for and
    benefits of doing so. w. hughes explains the prestel
    international market trial and discusses the future for prestel
    international.</text>
