    <text>utlas' an overview. describes the university of toronto's
    library automation system, which provides services in english
    and french to some 200 participating institutions. covers
    systems operation, services offered, availability, access
    points, data base source files, bibliographic record formats,
    cataloguing standards, and products. details are given of
