    <text>development of an information system for urban planning
    and human environment in sfry. paper presented at the european
    seminar on information systems, madrid, june 1979. the yugoslav
    project on an information system for urban planning is
    described. the development of the system, its characteristics,
    organisational structure, relationship with other systems,
    sources and users of information as well as tasks involved in
    its realisation are analysed.</text>
