    <text>information technologies for the 1980's' lasers and
    microprocessors. this discussion of the development and
    application of lasers and microprocessors to information
    processing stresses laser communication in relation to
    capacity, reliability, and cost and the advantages of this
    technology to real-time information access and information
    storage. the increased capabilities of microprocessors are
