    <recordId>38094</recordId>
    <text>the tensor formulation of ferromagnetic resonance</text>
  </DOC>
  <DOC>
    <recordId>38095</recordId>
    <text>a versatile pulse shaper a triggered miniature thyratron
    circuit is described for deriving sharp pulses with uniform
    amplitude and duration from an input of nonuniform pulses a
    table shows the output waveform for various circuit
    arrangements and component values</text>
  </DOC>
  <DOC>
    <recordId>38096</recordId>
    <text>evidence of some geomagnetic control on the layer the
    bifurcation of the noon f layer is found to be related to
