    <text>publications on complex problems of scientific and
    technical cooperation of the comecon countries. notes some
    features of the present development stage of scientific and
    technical cooperation among the comecon (eastern bloc)
    countries. the successful solution of the problems involved and
    the successful completion of cooperative tasks depend to a
    great extent on good information provision. considers the
