    <text>on computing certain elements of the inverse of a sparse
    matrix a recursive algorithm for computing the inverse of a
    matrix from the lu factors based on relationships in takahashi,
    et al., is examined. the formulas for the algorithm are given;
    the dependency relationships are derived; the computational
    costs are developed; and some general comments on application
    and stability are made. march, 1975 erisman, e. m. tinney, w.
    f. sparse matrices, triangular factorization, elements of
    inverse, tridiagonal matrix, sensitivities 3.24 5.14 ca750308
    jb january 9, 1978 4:34 pm</text>
