    <text>cover picture (wurzburg university library). a new
    university library for wurzburg was opened in july 81 in a new
    building complex which also comprises buildings for both arts
    and sciences. of the 400,000 volumes on open shelves, 317,000
    are in the main reading room and there is space for 800,000 are
    in the main reading room and thre is space for 800,000 volumes
    of periodicals. 580 study places are divided between 5 reading
    rooms, with a further 71 places in individual carrels. the
    library, which also serves as a regional library for lower
    franconia, is not fully operational at present because of staff
    shortages.</text>
  </DOC>
