    to the government. briefly summarises the fic act and the
    programme's history. examines the replies to a questionnaire
    survey of the 38 fics concerning volume of inquiries handled,
    sources of inquiries, methods of inquiries, type of reference
    tools used, choice and training of personnel, use of government
    publications, and user satisfaction.</text>
