    <text>local map sources: bargains from various agencies.
    reviews some of the cartographic bargains available from
    various us agencies other than the commonly used national
    geographic society, and contending that in west virginia a core
    collection of local maps may be acquired for $50.00 or less.
    agencies include the department of highways, west virginia
    geological and economic survey, and the department of natural
    resources.</text>
