    <text>terrestrial corpuscular radiation a note on the two van
    allen zones which are attributed to charged particles moving in
    closed trajectories formed by magnetic traps due to the earths
    magnetic field a graph based on american and russian rocket
    data shows the variation of the intensity of these zones with
    height a maximum intensity is recorded at a distance between km
    from the centre of the earth</text>
  </DOC>
